---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Produce to and consume from Kafka topics, without consumer groups

Usage: rustman kafka [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  produce  Produce messages (a kind: kafka request, or --value flags, or the lines of a piped stdin) and print their partitions and offsets
  consume  Read messages from a topic and print them as they arrive
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help

Examples:
  rustman kafka produce --brokers localhost:9092 --topic orders --key order-1 --value '{"id":1}'
  rustman kafka consume --brokers localhost:9092 --topic orders --offset earliest --max-messages 5 --json
  rustman kafka consume events/orders.rman.yaml --duration 10s
